        },
        {
          "text": "Na eekaa ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũthũku, akĩatĩĩa mothatyo ma mbaĩ ila Yeova wailũngilye mbee wa ana ma Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
