            "sid": "2KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na avĩtĩlya mwana wake mwakinĩ, na aingasya nyũnyi, na eekaa maũndũ ma mowe, na akũlasya ala mesene na maveva, na oombasya ithitũ: eekaa mũno ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũthũku, akĩmũthatya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
